start (200 frames)                                           19.096 ms mean
coarse schedule + native ingress and readback (300 frames)  11.127 ms mean, p99 11.565
+ balanced columns, trimmed inputs, kernel fix (500 frames)   8.213 ms mean, p99 8.637
+ contiguous folding (500 frames)                              8.107 ms mean, p99 8.608
+ host hot-path trims (500 frames)                             7.940 ms mean, p99 8.347
+ merged weight tasks (500 frames)                             7.849 ms mean, p99 8.189; dispatch 7.225 ms
witnessed test_11 on the final code: 7.898 ms mean, p99 8.270 ms (npu_inference_graph_engine_phoenix_20260914T0426Z.log)

== 7. Live camera (index 0 via MSMF, 640x480 at 30 fps, contiguous frames) [MEASURED]
tools/live_camera_ignition.py --headless --frames 60 --boxes npu before the two changes below: 8.134 ms mean (60 frames), 8.210 ms (120 frames)
predict_sync split on 200 camera frames: preprocess 0.429, NPU 7.442, postprocess 0.351 ms (0.085 on random frames); ~6 objects per frame
stage_image on a camera frame 0.364 ms median, the same as on a contiguous copy (no copy is made) and as on 1280x720 synthetic frames
postprocess replayed on 40 captured camera frames: 0.167 ms median in total (prune 0.039, candidate gather 0.033, DFL 0.016, others < 0.014)
blocking run.wait() vs polling run.state(): dispatch 7.237 vs 7.237 ms mean, decode 0.311 vs 0.313 ms (no idle-state effect)
-> the live decode paid for its first read of 672 KB of class logits right after worker threads wrote them (DERIVED)
changes: per-anchor class maxima computed natively during readback (8,400 B for the decoder's prune instead of the class
  tensors; identical detections, tests/test_graph_engine_offline.py test_12), and an identity-resize lookup copy when the frame
  needs no scaling (byte-identical, test_10 includes a 640x480 frame)
after: 7.702 ms mean, median 7.617, p95 7.966 (60 frames, unwitnessed); witnessed run with preflight and CPU sample:
  7.929 ms mean, median 7.869, p95 8.158, NPU 7.474 ms (camera_npu_boxes_phoenix_20260914T0426Z.log)
